WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.220 --> 00:00:05.880
All 41 workers who were trapped in a collapsed
Himalayan tunnel have now been rescued.

00:00:05.880 --> 00:00:12.019
I can give you a look once again at the exterior
of the tunnel that we've been closely watching

00:00:12.019 --> 00:00:17.610
where those construction workers were stuck,
of course, for the last 17 days.

00:00:17.610 --> 00:00:23.110
We're looking at a final ambulance it seems
outside of the tunnel entrance.

00:00:23.110 --> 00:00:26.360
Let's get back to vedika sud in New Delhi.

00:00:26.360 --> 00:00:35.000
Vedika, it's tough to find words to emphasize
the relief of the success of the 17-day mission.

00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:36.860
It's had plenty of setbacks.

00:00:36.860 --> 00:00:41.910
The relief of the officials there, the families,
and indeed the workers themselves, that for

00:00:41.910 --> 00:00:45.940
the first time in 17 days, breathing fresh
air.

00:00:45.940 --> 00:00:50.829
We &gt;&gt; Absolutely, it is nothing short of a
miracle.

00:00:50.829 --> 00:00:54.150
That is what a lot of officials on the ground
would say.

00:00:54.150 --> 00:00:55.150
But you know we want to

00:00:55.150 --> 00:00:56.150
[10:50:50 AM]

00:00:56.150 --> 00:01:00.400
But you know we want to acknowledge the achievement
of the state as well.

00:01:00.400 --> 00:01:05.869
The biggest challenge they face was the machine,
it was a how heavy drilling machine that broke

00:01:05.869 --> 00:01:07.299
down repeatedly.

00:01:07.299 --> 00:01:11.230
The last two meters that we covered today
was through manual drilling.

00:01:11.230 --> 00:01:17.400
They sent scores of rescue teams inside that
drilled through the debris, drilled through

00:01:17.400 --> 00:01:18.470
the middle.

00:01:18.470 --> 00:01:21.530
This is an ecologically fragile area.

00:01:21.530 --> 00:01:27.000
This tunnel collapsed partially because of
a landslide and this rubble in debris was

00:01:27.000 --> 00:01:30.140
of course unstable and on unsteady ground.

00:01:30.140 --> 00:01:37.479
It was equally dangerous sending rescue teams
inside as it would be to rescue those people

00:01:37.479 --> 00:01:38.920
who are trapped inside.

00:01:38.920 --> 00:01:43.909
There was scores of ambulances on standby
over the last S hours.

00:01:43.909 --> 00:01:48.300
We anticipate a lot of movements during the
day.

00:01:48.300 --> 00:01:49.600
That's exactly wouldappen.

00:01:49.600 --> 00:01:51.899
That is what we've seen.

00:01:51.899 --> 00:01:56.259
41 men have been successfully extracted from
the tunnel from

00:01:56.259 --> 00:01:57.259
[10:51:52 AM]

00:01:57.259 --> 00:02:02.290
extracted from the tunnel from a 50 meter
pipe which is about fifth D meters wide in

00:02:02.290 --> 00:02:03.290
diameter.

00:02:03.290 --> 00:02:08.129
They were pulled out after being mounted on
stretchers.

00:02:08.129 --> 00:02:14.370
They illuminated the entire passageway of
this path to make sure that these men, who

00:02:14.370 --> 00:02:21.739
have faced severe trauma, are pulled out gently
and reassured that they are on their way out

00:02:21.739 --> 00:02:24.070
and on their way to safety.

00:02:24.070 --> 00:02:30.260
Seconds later, after every man was pulled,
out they were whisked away in an ambulance

00:02:30.260 --> 00:02:34.480
away from the rebel, Julia, away from the
debris, away from danger.

00:02:34.480 --> 00:02:41.030
They were pulled away from uncertainty which
they had faced for 16 days.

00:02:41.030 --> 00:02:46.360
&gt;&gt; A police system was used in a far smaller
pipe than you are seeing here, which is this

00:02:46.360 --> 00:02:47.360
tunnel entrance.

00:02:47.360 --> 00:02:52.260
Just give us a sense of what you're seeing,
it seems on the side it is curtains.

00:02:52.260 --> 00:02:57.120
We did not really get to see the removal of
any of these workers, as we saw this

00:02:57.120 --> 00:02:58.120
[10:52:52 AM]

00:02:58.120 --> 00:03:00.210
workers, as we saw this operation take place
over the past hour.

00:03:00.210 --> 00:03:05.580
They were whisked into ambulances for the
most part and taken away, even as we saw their

00:03:05.580 --> 00:03:06.760
celebrations.

00:03:06.760 --> 00:03:13.170
Vedika, we will hear tales of heroism that
took place the past 17 days.

00:03:13.170 --> 00:03:17.620
In particular, as you said, when the machinery
broke, digging literally with her hands in

00:03:17.620 --> 00:03:20.750
order to try to get to these workers.

00:03:20.750 --> 00:03:22.780
Have we had any updates so far?

00:03:22.780 --> 00:03:23.920
And I know that it's early.

00:03:23.920 --> 00:03:27.100
But as you, said there was a hospital set
up inside the tunnel.

00:03:27.100 --> 00:03:33.359
Do have an update on the health of these men?

00:03:33.359 --> 00:03:34.720
&gt;&gt; I think we will have to wait a while.

00:03:34.720 --> 00:03:36.660
Maybe overnight, perhaps.

00:03:36.660 --> 00:03:38.569
It'slready about 9:00 here in India.

00:03:38.569 --> 00:03:40.000
That is local time.

00:03:40.000 --> 00:03:41.340
It's dark out there.

00:03:41.340 --> 00:03:46.690
The priority obviously is to take them to
a medical center to assess them overnight,

00:03:46.690 --> 00:03:50.580
to make sure that any needs are catered to
at this point.

00:03:50.580 --> 00:03:56.900
Especially mental health as a primary focus
for the medical experts who are tending to

00:03:56.900 --> 00:03:57.900
these men.

00:03:57.900 --> 00:03:58.900
[10:53:53 AM]

00:03:58.900 --> 00:03:59.900
these men.

00:03:59.900 --> 00:04:03.950
Over the last 70 days, Julia, there have been
pipelines through which oxygen has been supplied.

00:04:03.950 --> 00:04:09.510
Food has been supplied, initially it was dry
food, when they had a wider pipe if they started

00:04:09.510 --> 00:04:10.670
something in cooked food.

00:04:10.670 --> 00:04:12.540
There is water that's been sent in.

00:04:12.540 --> 00:04:15.770
Medicines, vitamin D, mobile chargers.

00:04:15.770 --> 00:04:21.800
They have assured that whatever they could
supply these men with through these very narrow

00:04:21.800 --> 00:04:27.820
pipelines, medical attendants, medical supervisors
have been on a megaphone with them over the

00:04:27.820 --> 00:04:32.259
past two weeks, they've been ex assessing
their condition, talking to them, telling

00:04:32.259 --> 00:04:38.120
them to eat, telling them to hydrate themselves
along with a constant assurance that they

00:04:38.120 --> 00:04:39.120
will be pulled out.

00:04:39.120 --> 00:04:44.320
That has culminated into what we're seeing
on our screen today, which is a huge success.

00:04:44.320 --> 00:04:45.500
Not sure -- short of a miracle.

00:04:45.500 --> 00:04:51.660
41 men pulled, out extracted from a tunnel
that collapsed partially on the 12th of November

00:04:51.660 --> 00:04:53.060
due to a landslide in the area.

00:04:53.060 --> 00:04:56.680
This is a very ecological fragile region.

00:04:56.680 --> 00:05:00.610
A lot of questions must be asked by environmentalists,
by

00:05:00.610 --> 00:05:01.610
[10:54:55 AM]

00:05:01.610 --> 00:05:05.030
asked by environmentalists, by ecological
experts, the government should also be held

00:05:05.030 --> 00:05:09.630
accountable at this point for what we've seen
over the last 17 days.

00:05:09.630 --> 00:05:14.590
It has been nothing short of a disappointment
to have these men stuck inside the tunnel.

00:05:14.590 --> 00:05:19.300
But today there has been success and, at least
for this, moment that should be celebrated,

00:05:19.300 --> 00:05:20.319
Julia.

00:05:20.319 --> 00:05:21.349
&gt;&gt; Certainly.

00:05:21.349 --> 00:05:23.240
You called it not far from a miracle.

00:05:23.240 --> 00:05:29.550
Most people watching this considered a miracle,
after 17 days diminish to get food, water,

00:05:29.550 --> 00:05:31.130
oxygen to them.

00:05:31.130 --> 00:05:33.270
To get all 41 safely out.

00:05:33.270 --> 00:05:37.259
Maybe we'll have to wait a few hours now until
we hear about their health.

00:05:37.259 --> 00:05:39.900
We will keep our fingers crossed on that front.

00:05:39.900 --> 00:05:46.669
I think we're witnessing a miracle in northern
India today, with all 41 of those workers

00:05:46.669 --> 00:05:47.669
out.

00:05:47.669 --> 00:05:49.770
Vedika, the families, we can only imagine.

00:05:49.770 --> 00:05:52.890
I know you've been talking with your team
to many of them.

00:05:52.890 --> 00:05:59.660
The sheer relief and joy at getting their
workers and family relations out safely after

00:05:59.660 --> 00:06:01.970
17 days of what can only

00:06:01.970 --> 00:06:02.970
[10:55:55 AM]

